					<i><span class="en">Theod. Prisc. 2, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Tard. 3, 5, 71</span></i>.—Hence, as <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ptarmĭ-cum</span></b> , i, n.,
